WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:19.031
What are dependent types?

00:19.031 --> 00:34.757
A length can live in the type.

00:34.757 --> 00:49.770
A proposition is a type.

00:49.770 --> 01:05.582
The identity theorem.

01:05.582 --> 01:22.116
Accept the proof. Reject the impostor.

01:22.116 --> 01:46.124
From dependent types to imported proofs.
